    the Checkin dialog not auto-focusing the comment field.\n- Fixed button capitalization
    in the Unity Version Control window to match Unity standards.\n- Fixed and localized
    the Checkin dialog progress label.\n- Fixed a NullReferenceException when opening
    history from a branch diff.\n- Fixed a potential NullReferenceException in the
